### Mixed Content Demo

::: {display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 2em; align-items: start;}

```java [highlight:line-by-line]
User user = new User("Alice");
user.setAge(25);
user.setRole("Admin");
System.out.println(user);
```

:::[sync-fragments]
User created: name="Alice"
[---]
Updated: age=25
[---]
Updated: role="Admin"  
[---]
![Final State](https://placehold.co/300x150/9b59b6/white?text=User+Object)
:::[sync-fragments]

:::
